    "why": [
      "Saves 68% irrigation water (809 mm/yr \u2014 ~11 flood irrigations and 445 hrs/ha of 5-HP borewell pumping) vs. baseline [FAO-56]. Directly counters regional GRACE-FO terrestrial water storage decline of 4.2 cm/yr.",
